# Whitelist: this package must only ever hold hand-picked config.
# Everything else in ~/.claude (secrets, caches, transcripts, plugins,
# projects, sessions, logs) stays machine-local and is never tracked.
*
!.gitignore
# settings.json stays machine-local: it drifts per machine (hooks, plugins, theme).
# settings.devbox.json is the portable subset, copied over settings.json on ephemeral devboxes.
!settings.devbox.json
!keybindings.json
# Hand-written skills only. The rest of skills/ is symlinks into ~/.agents/skills,
# which the skill installer owns via .skill-lock.json.
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/bro/
!skills/bro/**
!skills/delegate-to-worktree/
!skills/delegate-to-worktree/**
!skills/pr/
!skills/pr/**
# Add more as needed, e.g.:
# !CLAUDE.md
# !commands/
# !agents/
